{"assets":["/statement-assets/301d590088ba736c7cabd80a70ab9f566cd735919490f45e3091cdce585a5b45.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"178","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F2. Representative Sampling"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Smart Beaver from ABBYY has a long history of cooperating with the \"Institute of Cytology and Genetics\". Recently, the Institute staff challenged the Beaver with a new problem. The problem is as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a collection of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" proteins (not necessarily distinct). Each protein is a string consisting of lowercase Latin letters. The problem that the scientists offered to the Beaver is to select a subcollection of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" from the initial collection of proteins so that the representativity of the selected subset of proteins is maximum possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Smart Beaver from ABBYY did some research and came to the conclusion that the representativity of a collection of proteins can be evaluated by a single number, which is simply calculated. Let's suppose we have a collection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{a1, ..., ak}"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" strings describing proteins. The representativity of this collection is the following value:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/301d590088ba736c7cabd80a70ab9f566cd735919490f45e3091cdce585a5b45.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f(x, y)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the length of the longest common prefix of strings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":"; for example, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f("},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"kind":"math_inline","text":") = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f("},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bcd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"kind":"math_inline","text":") = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, the representativity of collection of proteins "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abe"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"}"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the representativity of collection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"}"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Having discovered that, the Smart Beaver from ABBYY asked the Cup contestants to write a program that selects, from the given collection of proteins, a subcollection of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" which has the largest possible value of representativity. Help him to solve this problem!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first input line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), separated by a single space. The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the descriptions of proteins, one per line. Each protein is a non-empty string of no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"500"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters consisting of only lowercase Latin letters ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"..."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Some of the strings may be equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input limitations for getting 20 points are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 20"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input limitations for getting 50 points are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input limitations for getting 100 points are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2000"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number denoting the largest possible value of representativity that a subcollection of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the given collection of proteins can have."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\naba\nbzd\nabq\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\neee\nrrr\nttt\nqqq\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\naaa\nabba\nabbc\nabbd\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F2","problemCode":"178F2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/178/problem/F2"}